<script setup lang="ts">
import {computed,ref} from 'vue'
import {useRoute} from 'vue-router'
import {useDb} from '../../../stores/db'
import {StatusBadge,PreviewBanner,KpiTile} from '../../../components/shared'
import {replayEvent} from '../domain'
import {fmtMoney} from '../../../lib/money'
const route=useRoute(),db=useDb(),tab=ref(String(route.query.tab||'campaigns')),message=ref(''),leads=db.data.leads,syncs=db.data.syncStatuses
const funnel=computed(()=>Object.fromEntries(['captured','valid','duplicate','offered','accepted','attempted','connected','qualified','appointment_booked','attended','booked','spa_executed'].map(stage=>[stage,leads.filter(lead=>lead.stage===stage).length])))
function replay(id:string,version:number){message.value=replayEvent({eventId:id,aggregateVersion:version,recordId:'booking-demo'}).result}
</script>
<template><div class="page"><header class="page-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">Growth and connections</p><h1>Nexus</h1><p>Campaigns, attribution, partner adapters, government routes and messaging.</p></div><PreviewBanner/></header><p v-if="message" class="card">{{message}}</p><div class="actions"><el-button v-for="name in ['campaigns','aivo','adapters','government','messaging','tools']" :key="name" :type="tab===name?'primary':''" @click="tab=name">{{name}}</el-button></div><section v-if="tab==='campaigns'" class="page"><div class="card-grid"><KpiTile v-for="(count,stage) in funnel" :key="stage" :label="String(stage)" :value="count"/></div><article v-for="campaign in db.data.campaigns" :key="campaign.id" class="card"><h2>{{campaign.name}}</h2><p>Funding {{campaign.funding}} · spend {{fmtMoney(campaign.spendMinor)}}</p><StatusBadge :label="campaign.state"/><p>Appointment booked differs from attended. Attribution never establishes commission entitlement.</p></article></section><section v-else-if="tab==='aivo'" class="card"><h2>AIVO sync</h2><article v-for="sync in syncs.filter(s=>s.partner==='AIVO')" :key="sync.id" class="data-row"><span>Last success {{sync.lastSuccessAt||'Unknown'}} · {{sync.pendingCount}} pending</span><StatusBadge :label="sync.state"/></article><div class="actions"><el-button @click="replay('EVT-100',6)">Replay event</el-button><el-button @click="replay('EVT-100',6)">Replay same event again</el-button><el-button @click="replay('EVT-OLD',4)">Replay out-of-order event</el-button></div><p>Consumers deduplicate by event ID and ignore stale aggregate versions.</p></section><section v-else-if="tab==='adapters'" class="card table-scroll"><h2>Partner adapters</h2><el-table :data="syncs"><el-table-column prop="partner" label="Provider"/><el-table-column label="State"><template #default="{row}"><StatusBadge :label="row.state"/></template></el-table-column><el-table-column prop="pendingCount" label="Pending"/></el-table><p>Direct banker and lawyer portals are the required manual route. Imports cannot overwrite posted money or source decisions.</p></section><section v-else-if="tab==='government'" class="card"><h2>Government and tax</h2><StatusBadge label="TO CONFIRM"/><div class="card-grid"><article><h3>HIMS</h3><p>Mapped → submitted → acknowledged → accepted/rejected.</p></article><article><h3>MyInvois</h3><p>HTTP 202 UUID differs from validation.</p></article><article><h3>SST</h3><p>Filing evidence and payment confirmation are separate.</p></article></div><p>No public API is assumed.</p></section><section v-else-if="tab==='messaging'" class="card"><h2>Messaging</h2><p>A failed message creates an owned recovery task. Read receipts do not prove acknowledgement.</p><StatusBadge label="Critical service notices"/><StatusBadge label="Marketing preference separate"/></section><section v-else class="card"><h2>Financing tools</h2><p>Mortgage estimate lives in the purchaser portal. CCRIS/CTOS requires consent, purpose, provider and report date; failed/no-hit/stale are not clean results.</p><StatusBadge label="TO CONFIRM"/></section></div></template>
